#
# Version 2.0.1 is the front-desk chat of a dental clinic, rebuilt as a server application with typed code.
# Each message goes through the same order: emergency check, medical and rule-break checks, booking request to a
# timed ticket, one checked AI attempt (8 seconds), then the keyword matcher on the clinic file with the label
# "Answered from the clinic file". A ticket is opened only when a person is needed. Tickets, messages and the
# clinic file are kept in a shared server store (the host's Redis today; Postgres when its address is set; Postgres
# is not connected and not tested). The staff page has a reply box on each ticket, a fixed order, the age of each
# ticket, a call-back list, close, and a clinic file editor with a checked save and a reset. The AI key stays on
# the server.
#
# Not rebuilt from 1.3.0.3: voice, the language menu, patient name and phone, the clinic info panel, staff search
# and filters, CSV export, ready-made replies, staff notes, patient feedback, background-tab sync.
#
